      "class": "page-hero"
    },
    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span><span class=\"time\">25 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip warn\">Medium</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Greedy</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Running sum</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/gas-station/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 134</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Gas Station</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Insight in one line: if the tank goes negative on the way from <code>start</code> to <code>i</code>, then no station in <code>[start, i]</code> can be the answer, so jump to <code>i + 1</code>; a start exists exactly when the total of <code>gas - cost</code> is not negative. One pass, O(n) time, O(1) space.</p>\n"
  },
